{"game": "arma-3", "language": "english", "appid": 107410, "month": "2015-02", "window": 3, "start_date": 1423958400, "end_date": 1424563199, "month_true_total": 573, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 11:03:21 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "14585147", "author": {"steamid": "76561198069135856", "personaname": "Ryan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/569523412/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 19890, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 10883, "last_played": 1736694870, "avatar": "5ff7f4900c0bdb0d06a8ab6e7d5a940464d747be"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you like to play around with friends, and are sick and tired of the jet-ramming in Battlefield, you came to the right place.  Welcome to the most immersive gameplay you'll ever find yourself in, and dont forget about the in-game editor, gun game,   \nbattle royale, wasteland, and altis life.  If this doesn't intrigue your interest, you came to the wrong place.\n          When you first enter the game, you might be a little choppy.  I would suggest going to the many tutorials and scenarios that Arma 3 has to offer.  Once you learn the controls, you might want to try out your skills in Zeus Mode, the offline/online in-game editor.  After that you can try one of the many servers available to you.\n        This game is worth the money.\nBuy it", "timestamp_created": 1424561264, "timestamp_updated": 1424561264, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "14585100", "author": {"steamid": "76561197962526463", "personaname": "Ircof", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Ircof/", "num_games_owned": 192, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 124076, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 22677, "last_played": 1781470120, "avatar": "e282ab5ae1c537259b16405af205b33da08598d2"}, "language": "english", "review": "The Game is so Creative and fun, you can nearly do anything in it, as long as the theme is WAR!\n\nThere is no better way to explore your skills as a commander of an AI Army, or even try your luck as a Crewman in a Tank or Chopper. The Limet of this game in army combat is your own, also try all the mods that alow a huge verity of gaming in this theme.\n\nGood Luck out there!", "timestamp_created": 1424561063, "timestamp_updated": 1424561063, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "14585069", "author": {"steamid": "76561197980010747", "personaname": "Kroxem", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197980010747/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 22454, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 14859, "last_played": 1750359666, "avatar": "9cc2d10975069eed4a01a70afdb66ec3ac8ecf5c"}, "language": "english", "review": "awsome sandbox fps military action :D\n\nbest >mod< in my my opinion is  King of the Hill  ->>>  http://armakoth.com/   <<<-", "timestamp_created": 1424560943, "timestamp_updated": 1424561084, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "14584931", "author": {"steamid": "76561197960269218", "personaname": "Shinjuru", "persona_statu